---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use | KB Compressor" description="Terms of use for KB Compressor.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Using this tool</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          KB Compressor is provided free of charge for compressing images you own or have the
          right to use. You may use it for personal, educational, or commercial purposes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">No guarantee against official requirements</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Pages on this site reference file size and format requirements for third-party
          forms and portals (for example, college applications, job applications, and
          passport or visa photo uploads). These are provided as general guidance and may
          change without notice. Always confirm the exact requirements on the official
          portal or agency website before submitting a photo &mdash; KB Compressor is not
          affiliated with, and cannot guarantee acceptance by, any government agency,
          university, employer, or application platform.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This tool is provided "as is," without warranty of any kind. We don't guarantee
          that compression will be error-free, uninterrupted, or that a specific target size
          will always be reached exactly.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          KB Compressor is not liable for any loss or damage arising from use of this tool,
          including a rejected application or submission. You are responsible for verifying
          that your compressed image meets the requirements of wherever you're submitting it.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the site after a
          change means you accept the updated terms.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions about these terms can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:contact@pixtokb.com" class="text-indigo-600 underline dark:text-indigo-400">contact@pixtokb.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
